{"authored" [] "sources" [{"question" "q-19789" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $a=⟨-2,2,0⟩$ and $b=⟨0,2,-3⟩.$ Find $a\\times b.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-19789" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -2 & 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((2)(-3)-(2)(0))i-((-2)(-3)-(0)(0))j+((-2)(2)-(0)(2))k \\\\  & =(-6-0)i-(6-0)j+(-4-0)k \\\\  & =-6i-6j-4k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-19789" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0118fa4be877af9d984d96913b8c4eb3649797d2aa3621bd31fccb9b4080a716"} {"question" "q-19789" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-19789" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-4i-6j-4k"] ["math" "-6i+6j-4k"] ["math" "-6i-4j-4k"] ["math" "-6i-6j-4k"] ["math" "6i-4j-6k"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-19789" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "-6i-6j-4k"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-281969" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $u=⟨3,4,-1⟩$ and $v=⟨2,-5,2⟩.$ Find $u\\times v.$\n\n$u\\times v=⟨${{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}$,$\n{{field-3}}$⟩$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-281969" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ -5 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 \\\\ 2 & -5\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(4\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot (-5))i-(3\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 2)j+(3\\cdot (-5)-4\\cdot 2)k \\\\  & =(8-5)i-(6+2)j+(-15-8)k \\\\  & =3i-8j-23k \\\\  & =⟨3,-8,-23⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-281969" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0118fa4be877af9d984d96913b8c4eb3649797d2aa3621bd31fccb9b4080a7