 "value" "Let $a=⟨0,1,6⟩$ and $b=⟨13,0,0⟩.$ Find $a\\times b.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-1407" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 0 & 1 & 6 \\\\ 13 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}0 & 6 \\\\ 13 & 0\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 13 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(1\\cdot 0-6\\cdot 0)i-(0\\cdot 0-6\\cdot 13)j+(0\\cdot 0-1\\cdot 13)k \\\\  & =(0-0)i-(0-78)j+(0-13)k \\\\  & =78j-13k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-1407" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0118fa4be877af9d984d96913b8c4eb3649797d2aa3621bd31fccb9b4080a716"} {"question" "q-1407" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-1407" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "⟨-6,-78,13⟩"] ["math" "⟨-6,0,-13⟩"] ["math" "⟨-6,78,-13⟩"] ["math" "⟨0,78,-13⟩"] ["math" "⟨0,78,13⟩"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-1407" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "⟨0,78,-13⟩"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-1393" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $u=⟨4,5,-1⟩$ and $v=⟨-6,0,2⟩.$ Find $u\\times v.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-1393" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & 5 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}4 & -1 \\\\ -6 & 2\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}4 & 5 \\\\ -6 & 0\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =(5\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 0)i-(4\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot (-6))j+(4\\cdot 0-5\\cdot (-6))k \\\\  & =(10-0)i-(8-6)j+(0-(-30))k \\\\  & =10i-2j+30k.\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/state.json" "file_sha256" "c674633b21c6588b958297ac2f06835b9cdc61ec31fc9669ff000f9e8e7d917e"} {"question" "q-1393" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14039715/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0118fa4be877af9d984d96913b8c4eb3649797d2aa3621bd31fccb9b4080a716"} {"question" "q-1393" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/